{"authored" [] "sources" [{"question" "q-70302" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find the solution of $-{x}^{2}+3x\\ge 0.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14004892/state.json" "file_sha256" "e24df0582909315adb72fd277f390f540723e960e189ef30bf731563e1ac64f6"} {"question" "q-70302" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To solve the inequality \n\n$$\n-{x}^{2}+3x\\ge 0,\n$$\n\nwe need to find the values of $x$ for which the parabola \n\n$$\ny=-{x}^{2}+3x\n$$\n\nlies *above* the $x$-axis or touches this axis.\n\nFirst, let's find the roots of the parabola:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-{x}^{2}+3x & =0 \\\\ -x(x-3) & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the roots are $x=0$ and $x=3,$ and we can graph the parabola as follows:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14004892/assets/68d82c96c820a6a0bf5e3c74ea93cbf2091e96ebfa7dfe200e8beb140cb7962e.png)\n\nThe values marked in blue show all $x$-values where the parabola lies *above* the axis or touches the $x$-axis. \n\nSo, the solution to the inequality is $0\\le x\\le 3.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14004892/state.json" "file_sha256" "e24df0582909315adb72fd277f390f540723e960e189ef30bf731563e1ac64f6"} {"question" "q-70302" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14004892/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "50c6f502bd60fceea6148813148952d7c9f32825dff9e7c7a62692e856f6f20d"} {"question" "q-70302" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14004892/state.json" "file_sha256" "e24df0582909315adb72fd277f390f540723e960e189ef30bf731563e1ac64f6"} {"question" "q-70302" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-3\\le x\\le 0"] ["math" "-3\\le x\\le 3"] ["math" "0\\le x\\le 3"] ["text" "$x\\le -3$ or $x\\ge 0$"] ["text" "$x\\le 0$ or $x\\ge 3$"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14004892/state.json" "file_sha256" "e24df0582909315adb72fd277f390f540723e960e189ef30bf731563e1ac64f6"} {"question" "q-70302" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "0\\le x\\le 3"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14004892/state.json" "file_sha256" "e24df0582909315adb72fd277f390f540723e960e189ef30bf731563e1ac64f6"} {"question" "q-75992" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find the solution of $-{x}^{2}-2x+15>0.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14004892/state.json" "file_sha256" "e24df0582909315adb72fd277f390f540723e960e189ef30bf731563e1ac64f6"} {"question" "q-75992" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To solve the inequality \n\n$$\n-{x}^{2}-2x+15>0,\n$$\n\nwe need to find the values of $x$ for which the parabola \n\n$$\ny=-{x}^{2}-2x+15\n$$\n\nlies *above* the $x$-axis.\n\nFirst, let's find the roots of the parabola:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-{x}^{2}-2x+15 & =0 \\\\ -({x}^{2}+2x-15) & =0 \\\\ -(x+5)(x-3) & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the roots are $x=-5$ and $x=3,$ and we can graph the parabola as follows:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14004892/assets/da88a1971a7a389c8f5b59ebd3cef2a146eb09113c3e71031bf9dfb6cdbe91e1.png)\n\nThe values marked in blue show all $x$-values where the parabola lies *above* the axis. \n\nSo, the solution to the inequality is $-5<x<3.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14004892/state.json" "file_sha256" "e24df0582909315adb72fd277f390f540723e960e189ef30bf731563e1ac64f6"} {"question" "q-75992" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14004892/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "50c6f502bd60fceea6148813148952d7c9f32825dff9e7c7a62692e856f6f20d"} {"question" "q-75992" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14004892/state.json" "file_sha256" "e24df0582909315adb72fd277f390f540723e960e189ef30bf731563e1ac64f6"} {"question" "q-75992" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-3<x<5"] ["math" "-5<x<3"] ["math" "x>-5"] ["text" "$x<-3$ or $x>5$"] ["text" "$x<-5$ or $x>3$"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14004892/state.json" "file_sha256" "e24df0582909315adb72fd277f390f540723e960e189ef30bf731563e1ac64f6"} {"question" "q-75992" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-5<x<3"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14004892/state.json" "file_sha256" "e24df0582909315adb72fd277f390f540723e960e189ef30bf731563e1ac64f6"} {"question" "q-277261" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find the solution of ${x}^{2}+6x\\ge 0.$\n\n$x\\le $\n{{field-1}}$\\,\\text{or}\\,x$\n{{field-2}}{{field-3}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14004892/state.json" "file_sha256" "e24df0582909315adb72fd277f390f540723e960e189ef30bf731563e1ac64f6"} {"question" "q-277261" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To solve the inequality \n\n$$\n{x}^{2}+6x\\ge 0,\n$$\n\nwe need to find the values of $x$ for which the parabola \n\n$$\ny={x}^{2}+6x\n$$\n\nlies *above* the $x$-axis or touches this axis.\n\nFirst, let's find the roots of the parabola:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}+6x & =0 \\\\ x(x+6) & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the roots are $x=0$ and $x=-6,$ and we can graph the parabola as follows:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14004892/assets/7d9fd824b1e4d63e417e002c07a01adb4c14f73fc81be66c31a5c9aa30ab7ffd.png)\n\nThe values marked in blue show all $x$-values where the parabola lies *above* the $x$-axis or touches this axis.\n\nSo, the solution to the inequality is $x\\le -6$ or $x\\ge 0.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14004892/state.json" "file_sha256" "e24df0582909315adb72fd277f390f540723e960e189ef30bf731563e1ac64f6"} {"question" "q-277261" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14004892/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "50c6f502bd60fceea6148813148952d7c9f32825dff9e7c7a62692e856f6f20d"} {"question" "q-277261" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14004892/state.json" "file_sha256" "e24df0582909315adb72fd277f390f540723e960e189ef30bf731563e1ac64f6"} {"question" "q-277261" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-6"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14004892/state.json" "file_sha256" "e24df0582909315adb72fd277f390f540723e960e189ef30bf731563e1ac64f6"} {"question" "q-277261" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14004892/state.json" "file_sha256" "e24df0582909315adb72fd277f390f540723e960e189ef30bf731563e1ac64f6"} {"question" "q-277261" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\ge"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14004892/state.json" "file_sha256" "e24df0582909315adb72fd277f390f540723e960e189ef30bf731563e1ac64f6"} {"question" "q-277261" "field" "field-3" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14004892/state.json" "file_sha256" "e24df0582909315adb72fd277f390f540723e960e189ef30bf731563e1ac64f6"} {"question" "q-277261" "field" "field-3" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "0"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14004892/state.json" "file_sha256" "e24df0582909315adb72fd277f390f540723e960e189ef30bf731563e1ac64f6"} {"question" "q-142180" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find the solution of $-{x}^{2}+9x-18\\ge 0.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14004892/state.json" "file_sha256" "e24df0582909315adb72fd277f390f540723e960e189ef30bf731563e1ac64f6"} {"question" "q-142180" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To solve the inequality \n\n$$\n-{x}^{2}+9x-18\\ge 0,\n$$\n\nwe need to find the values of $x$ for which the parabola \n\n$$\ny=-{x}^{2}+9x-18\n$$\n\nlies *above* the $x$-axis or touches this axis.\n\nFirst, let's find the roots of the parabola:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-{x}^{2}+9x-18 & =0 \\\\ -({x}^{2}-9x+18) & =0 \\\\ -(x-3)(x-6) & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the roots are $x=3$ and $x=6,$ and we can graph the parabola as follows:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14004892/assets/d4c28d26425c3c5bfc95dece73c8d8cb74f395f2de04a2c2ee1b1fd69f8433ed.png)\n\nThe values marked in blue show all $x$-values where the parabola lies *above* the axis or touches the $x$-axis. \n\nSo, the solution to the inequality is $3\\le x\\le 6.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14004892/state.json" "file_sha256" "e24df0582909315adb72fd277f390f540723e960e189ef30bf731563e1ac64f6"} {"question" "q-142180" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14004892/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "50c6f502bd60fceea6148813148952d7c9f32825dff9e7c7a62692e856f6f20d"} {"question" "q-142180" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14004892/state.json" "file_sha256" "e24df0582909315adb72fd277f390f540723e960e189ef30bf731563e1ac64f6"} {"question" "q-142180" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "3<x<6"] ["math" "3\\le x\\le 6"] ["text" "$x<3$ or $x>6$"] ["text" "$x\\le -6$ or $x\\ge -3$"] ["text" "$x\\le 3$ or $x\\ge 6$"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14004892/state.json" "file_sha256" "e24df0582909315adb72fd277f390f540723e960e189ef30bf731563e1ac64f6"} {"question" "q-142180" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "3\\le x\\le 6"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14004892/state.json" "file_s